# The test tools of the integration; the test plugin pins Home Assistant itself.
# Renovate keeps this list and the hash-pinned requirements-test.txt current. The
# lock file is compiled with `uv pip compile --python-version=` for the Python of
# the CI, and Renovate compiles it again with the command in its header (see
# .github/renovate-blueprint.json5). The test plugin is pinned: a Home Assistant
# that needs a newer Python fails its update instead of an older Home Assistant
# being chosen.
